&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring accounting in-house at SPARETECH, globally, for our German GmbH and our US Inc. You will be hands-on with bookkeeping, revenue recognition, and consolidation, and you will strategically move them onto one scalable global Accounting solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our business grows, you will make sure our accounting is accurate, high quality, and compliant with German and US requirements, giving SPARETECH a reliable financial foundation for every next step.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build from the ground up:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Bring accounting in-house from external advisors and set up a function that scales with the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own accounting globally:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Take full responsibility for bookkeeping, month-end close, and annual financial statements for our German and US entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the core processes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Own revenue recognition, purchase-to-pay, and order-to-cash accounting, as well as correct balance sheet bookings and asset tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring the group together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Design and run a clear consolidation process across both entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose the tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Select and roll out a scalable global accounting and consolidation solution, building on today&#39;s setup of DATEV in Germany and NetSuite in the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with experts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work with our tax advisors and with auditors as the go-to person for accounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Take on new challenges as our business, products, and reporting requirements grow, with a steep learning curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work your way:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work fully remote from anywhere in Germany, in close collaboration with our VP Finance and a small, hands-on finance team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become part of our team if you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have ideally 3 to 8 years of accounting experience, including accounting in a startup. Experience at a Big 4 or mid-tier audit firm is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know German GAAP:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have strong knowledge of German GAAP (HGB), including experience with consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand SaaS revenue:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have experience with revenue recognition in a SaaS or subscription business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have a solid foundation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Hold a university degree in accounting, finance, or business. A professional qualification such as ACCA or CPA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add an international view:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Bring knowledge of US accounting standards (US GAAP), or experience with DATEV, NetSuite, or implementing accounting software. Each is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate where it counts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Look for ways to automate processes, including with AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like to get hands-on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Enjoy making the bookings yourself while keeping the bigger picture in view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work independently, stay pragmatic and solution-oriented in a scaling company, and enjoy building processes from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep growing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Are eager to learn and constantly seek new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak fluently:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Are fluent in German and English.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt; in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000€ for your professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidized &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/a&gt; gym membership to stay active.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.corporate-benefits.de/&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;This posting is intended for talent pipelining and anticipated project needs. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be added to our talent network for upcoming opportunities. Please note that aside from the application confirmation email, no additional emails will be sent. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Should an active opening match your background and experience, our recruitment team will reach out directly to discuss next steps.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Retail Media Consultant (div/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt; who is passionate about Amazon and the broader retail media ecosystem. Joining our team of 100+ marketplace specialists across diverse disciplines, you will lead complex, multi-market client portfolios and drive growth across the entire customer journey. In this role, you will connect the dots between Retail, Sponsored Ads, Amazon DSP, AMC, and overarching digital marketing strategies. You will act as a trusted strategic advisor for clients, a mentor for junior colleagues, and a key driver of innovation within our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Management &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Complex Portfolios:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee large-scope, multi-market client accounts and comfortably manage annual advertising budgets exceeding €1,000,000;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop out-of-the-box, full-funnel strategies connecting Sponsored Ads, Amazon DSP, AMC, and other marketplaces/channels, as well as hybrid seller/vendor models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workshops &amp;amp; Business Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead client calls, QBRs, and strategic workshops, providing advanced forecasts, budget allocations, and overarching recommendations both inside and outside of Amazon DSP;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Build reporting structures from scratch, customizing them to client preferences and using strategic performance analyses (market insights, share, audience, and inventory insights) to form actionable conclusions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Involvement in pitches from preparation to presentation, identify upsell opportunities (SA, DSP, AMC, Retail, Strategic Consulting), and manage the process through to new contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mentorship &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a go-to technical expert and mentor, leading by example in quality assurance, task briefings, and communication while supporting Juniors and Professionals with advanced forecasts, business reviews, and strategic guidance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Team Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive digital advertising expertise by creating and delivering proactive trainings to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of experience in Amazon, E-Commerce, Online Marketing, or Retail Media (including at least 3 years dedicated to Amazon Advertising);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master of Amazon Sponsored Ads; familiar with AMC, DSP, ARA, Vendor/Seller Central, hybrid models, programmatic advertising/optimization, and other marketplaces/DSPs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level in Excel/Google Sheets and PowerPoint/Google Slides;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to streamline daily workflows, create new processes, and continuously improve team operations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, self-motivated, and collaborative with a track record of driving change, leading side projects, and mentoring peers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly located and available to work in Germany;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full working proficiency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working policy (1-2 days at the office, depending on location);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lease bike options / JobRad and 25% subsidy for the Deutschlandticket;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional breakfast/lunch at the office, Smoothie Tuesdays;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€30 per month - You can use the flexible package for digital food stamps and/or fitness providers/sport clubs/massage studios, internet costs, and/ or public transport;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Bens - Exclusive access to sustainable, healthy products at attractive deals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
